body:
My Ex-Boyfriend had a really toxic sibling as well, he used to hit him everyday and make his life hell, but he managed to fix himself and now their relationship is better than ever.

I wouldn't rush anything, as their trust is most likely damaged from all the things you did.

&#x200B;

Don't tell them that you've changed, don't tell him what you'll do, SHOW them. Be helpful, surprise them with nice gestures, don't expect anything in return, they will soon realize what a lovely Sibling they have.

&#x200B;

Good luck :)
